{"unit_id":"tag:024S:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n前面的定理让我们对无分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）的“刚性（rigidity）”有了一些认识。下面的命题提供了进一步的说明；它本身颇有趣味，而且在代数（algebraic）基本（fundamental）群（group）理论中也很有用（见<REF_0001>）。另见更一般的《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0002>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"rigidity","target_term":"刚性"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"所讨论的态射性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"刚性所针对的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"rigidity","target_term":"刚性","context":"原文引号中的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数","context":"代数基本群中的限定；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"fundamental","target_term":"基本","context":"基本群这一概念的限定；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"所提及理论中的基本群；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024V:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>无分歧（unramified）且分离（separated）。\n设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>-概形（scheme），且<MATH_0005>是一个点（point）。\n设<MATH_0006>是两个<MATH_0007>-态射（morphisms）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0008>连通（connected），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009>，以及\n<STRUCT_0004> 所诱导的映射（maps）<MATH_0010>在剩余域（residue fields）上相等。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则<MATH_0011>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"共同基底及基上的对象；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"给定结构态射的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"同一结构态射的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"给定的数学点；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"需要比较的两个基上映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通","context":"比较映射的源的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"剩余域之间诱导的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域","context":"第三条件比较的域；译名待决。"}],"notes":["源文开头Let ... is be含重复系动词；记录为源文笔误，不添加正文说明。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024V:proof","translation":"映射（maps）<MATH_0001>定义映射（maps）<MATH_0002>，它们是结构映射（map）<MATH_0003>的截面（sections）。\n注意，<MATH_0004>当且仅当<MATH_0005>。\n结构映射（map）<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>的基变换（base change），因而也无分歧（unramified）且分离（separated）（见《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0001>及《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0002>）。\n因此，由定理<REF_0003>，只须证明<MATH_0008>与<MATH_0009>经过<MATH_0010>的同一个点（point）。而这恰由假设（2）与（3）保证，即<MATH_0011>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"原映射以及由它们定义的图像映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"基变换后的结构映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"结构映射的右逆；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"结构映射与原态射的关系；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"基变换保持的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"基变换保持的另一性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"两个截面共经的数学点；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0AKI:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）无分歧（unramified）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>是态射（morphism），且<MATH_0004>诺特（Noetherian）。则<MATH_0005>是有限集（finite set）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian scheme","target_term":"诺特概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian scheme","target_term":"诺特概形","context":"共同基底的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"第一态射的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"第一态射的局部性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"两个给定的基上映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"第二态射的源的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集","context":"所有基上态射构成的集合；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0AKI:proof","translation":"首先假设<MATH_0001>分离（separated）（实践中经常如此）。\n由于<MATH_0002>诺特（Noetherian），它只有有限（finitely）多个连通分支（connected components）。因此可假设<MATH_0003>连通（connected）。选取点（point）<MATH_0004>，其像（image）为<MATH_0005>。\n由于<MATH_0006>无分歧（unramified）且拟紧（quasi-compact），纤维（fibre）<MATH_0007>有限（finite），不妨写成<MATH_0008>，而<MATH_0009>是有限（finite）域（field）扩张（extension）。\n见《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>及<REF_0003>。\n对每个<MATH_0010>，至多存在有限（finitely）多个<MATH_0011>-代数（algebra）映射（maps）<MATH_0012>（由初等域（field）理论）。\n因此，由命题<REF_0004>，<MATH_0013>有限（finite）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n一般情形。存在非空开集（nonempty open）<MATH_0014>，使得<MATH_0015>有限（finite）（特别地，分离（separated）），见《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0005>（该引理适用，因为上面已看到拟紧（quasi-compact）无分歧（unramified）态射（morphism）拟有限（quasi-finite），并且由《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理可知<MATH_0016>拟分离（quasi-separated），所用引理为<REF_0006>）。\n设<MATH_0017>为约化（reduced）闭子概形（closed subscheme），其支撑位于（supported on）<MATH_0018>的补集（complement）上。由诺特（Noetherian）归纳法（induction），可知<MATH_0019>有限（finite）（细节从略）。\n由第一段的结果，集合（set）<MATH_0020>有限（finite）。因此只须证明\n<MATH_0021>\n是单射的（injective）。这是因为，两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0022>一致（agree）的点（points）的集合（set）在<MATH_0023>中是开的（open），其原因是<MATH_0024>是开的（open），见《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0007>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"finitely","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"connected components","target_term":"连通分支"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finitely","target_te