{"unit_id":"tag:06ND:title","translation":"普遍（Universally）单射的（injective）无分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换后仍保持性质的限定，保留大写；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"基变换后底层映射的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"共同要求的态射性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节研究对象；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06ND:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾，概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>称为普遍（universally）单射的（injective），如果<MATH_0002>的任意基变换（base change）都是单射的（injective）（针对底层拓扑空间（topological spaces）），见《态射（Morphisms）》中的定义<REF_0001>。\n普遍（Universally）单射的（injective）且无分歧（unramified）的态射（morphisms）可以如下刻画。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的源与靶；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"定义中给定的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换后的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"底层拓扑映射的单射性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"普遍性定义中的操作；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"单射性所指的底层空间；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"后句句首的普遍性限定；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"待刻画的另一性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"最后一句的研究对象；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05VH:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>无分歧（unramified）且为单态射（monomorphism），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003>无分歧（unramified）且普遍（universally）单射（injective），\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0004>局部有限型（locally of finite type）且为单态射（monomorphism），\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0005>普遍（universally）单射（injective）、局部有限型（locally of finite type），且形式无分歧（formally unramified），\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0006>局部有限型（locally of finite type），并且<MATH_0007>或者为空的（empty），或者<MATH_0008>是同构（isomorphism），此要求对所有<MATH_0009>成立。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式无分歧"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空的"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"源与靶；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"五个条件的逻辑关系；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"前两个条件的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"范畴意义的单态射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换后的限定；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","t