{"unit_id":"tag:05VH:proof","translation":"我们已在《态射（Morphisms）进阶》中的引理<REF_0001>中看到，形式无分歧（formally unramified）且局部有限型（locally of finite type），也就是无分歧（unramified）。因此（4）与（2）等价（equivalent）。\n单态射（monomorphism）当然普遍（universally）单射（injective）且形式无分歧（formally unramified），故（3）蕴含（4）。显然，（1）蕴含（3）。最后，若（2）成立，则<MATH_0001>既为开浸入（open immersion）（《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0002>），又是满射的（surjective）（《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0003>），因而是同构（isomorphism），即<MATH_0002>是单态射（monomorphism）。由此可见，（2）蕴含（1）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n条件（3）蕴含（5），因为单态射（monomorphisms）在基变换（base change）下保持（《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0004>），并且由《概形（Schemes）》中关于到域（fields）的谱（spectra）的单态射（monomorphisms）的描述可知，所述描述见引理<REF_0005>。\n条件（5）蕴含（4），由《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0006>和<REF_0007>可知。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式无分歧"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式无分歧"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；译名待决。