{"unit_id":"tag:024W:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面给出几个例子。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[],"unknown_terms":[],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024X:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是域（field）。\n无分歧（Unramified）拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>是仿射的（affine）。\n这是因为<MATH_0003>的维数（dimension）为<MATH_0004>，且诺特（Noetherian），从而是有限（finite）离散（discrete）集合（set）；每个点（point）都给出一个仿射开集（affine open），故<MATH_0005>是仿射概形（affines）的有限（finite）不交并（disjoint union），因而仿射（affine）。\n诺特正规化（Noether normalization）迫使<MATH_0006>为一个有限（finite）<MATH_0007>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0008>的谱（spectrum）。\n这个代数（algebra）是<MATH_0009>的有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）的积（product）。\n因此，到<MATH_0010>的无分歧（unramified）拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism）对应于<MATH_0011>的有限（finite）多个有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）。\n特别地，无分歧（unramified）态射（morphism）若源（source）连通（connected）而靶（target）只有一个点（point），就必为有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extension）。\n我们稍后将看到，<MATH_0012>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）当且仅当它无分歧（unramified）。因此，至少在这种情形，得到了概形（scheme）的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）的一个非常简单的描述。当然，这个拓扑（topology）的上同调（cohomology）又是另一回事。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"Unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"Noether normalization","target_term":"诺特正规化"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"基域以及可分扩张中的域；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"第二句句首的性质，保留大写；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"使态射可由有限扩张描述的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"第二句所述的映射类别；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"第二句给出的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"源概形的零维性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"源概形的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"集合、不交并、代数及扩张个数的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"d